vid2note incorporates and evolves code from ai_srt2md, an earlier project by
the same author. The imported kernel covers subtitle parsing, prompt handling,
LLM adapters, note generation, task persistence, and mind-map export. vid2note
adds media ingestion, speech-to-text, the six-stage pipeline, retention,
screenshot embedding, the Vue web application, and container deployment.

Third-party packages remain subject to their respective licenses. See the
Python and Node dependency manifests for the complete dependency set. PDF text
extraction uses pypdf under its BSD-3-Clause license; PyMuPDF is not a runtime
dependency.
